<title>HONG KONG: Lap Heng changes name to Guoco Land.</title>
<headline>Lap Heng changes name to Guoco Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lap Heng Co Ltd said on Wednesday it has changed the company name to Guoco Land Ltd, and that its short name on the Hong Kong stock exchange would be &quot;Guoco Land&quot; with effect from January 30.</p>
<p>In November, Guoco Group Ltd made a general offer of HK$10.177 per share for Lap Heng after buying out the controlling shareholders and subscribing to new shares.</p>
<p>Guaco Group owns about 78.44 million shares or 77.43 percent of the issued share capital of Lap Heng following the general offer.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
